    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Break the Prophecies of Doom.</strong> <br>A Norse Mythology \u00d7 Modern Simulation AdventureMassive tsunamis, flame giants, cracks splitting the earth\u2014 In a modern world haunted by whispered &quot;Prophecies of Doom,&quot; <br>a mysterious figure named <strong>Shuka</strong>, who calls himself a &quot;Prophet,&quot; sets out with a group of secretive companions to destroy these prophecies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b3629c30110e06aa9f16d6dc6260da94.poster.avif?t=1752892063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b3629c30110e06aa9f16d6dc6260da94.webm?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b3629c30110e06aa9f16d6dc6260da94.mp4?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simulation adventure set in the modern world, based on the aftermath of the Norse apocalypse\u2014<strong>Ragnar\u00f6k</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the player, you become <strong>Shuka, the Black Angel of Prophecy</strong>,<br>traveling across the lands with local guides to unravel each omen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/f4bc65024f0e77332fe3c53f8eef5441.poster.avif?t=1752892063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/f4bc65024f0e77332fe3c53f8eef5441.webm?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/f4bc65024f0e77332fe3c53f8eef5441.mp4?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through roguelite-style events, battles, and dates,<br>you\u2019ll strengthen your companions and shatter each of the six doomsday prophecies, one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/e18be1a41de015900ad518771a21fabf.poster.avif?t=1752892063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/e18be1a41de015900ad518771a21fabf.webm?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/e18be1a41de015900ad518771a21fabf.mp4?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through conflict and connection,<br>you\u2019ll uncover your companions\u2019 pasts\u2014and their true intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b333938042336736320759d85c8de630.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of them has something they want to protect,<br>and those desires lead to misunderstandings and friction.What awaits your companions at the end of all shattered prophecies...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b93a1b1c4b7d312be60bdf68fed78cd8.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shuca</strong><br>A mysterious being who declares, \u201cI will destroy the prophecies.\u201d<br>Possesses the power to return from death and gathers companions for his cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b6abe58ab1b3f2076cc38ea7614cf58c.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yocto Lu</strong><br>A lonely boy from the 1st Land, forcibly recruited by Shuca.<br>Feared and reviled as the \u201cWolf\u201d destined to end the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/8c6975ddcde48fceb33f0638202693e6.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zeyn Guit</strong><br>A mercenary leader in the 2nd Land, hired by Shuca to join the journey.<br>Short-tempered, but acts like a big sister figure who keeps the team in check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/e82d13b18276708830d21c1cada21f6b.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Halvman Fitzgerald</strong><br>A young man from the 3rd Land who joins the journey of his own will.<br>Strategic and devoted, he dotes on Shuca a little <i>too</i> much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/d50f72c7b0e3a6a3faa105087c0f2ffe.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elmi Gale</strong><br>A girl dispatched from the 5th Land. Known for her sharp tongue and cold demeanor.<br>A stoic professional who calmly cleans up any mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Studio Warehuman / Higatani</strong><br>An indie creator based in Aichi, Japan.<br><i>Warehuman</i> is their debut title.<br>They are also the organizer of the indie game exhibition <strong>Aichi Game Castle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Message from the Creator\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I was fascinated by the grotesque beauty of Norse mythology's worldview\u2014<br>where the strong are just and the weak are evil. That\u2019s why I created this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even those who are seen as villains and losers\u2014<br>can still become the light that saves the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made with the hope that it might support those<br>who are struggling in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...And that\u2019s all from m\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/7696829401de0e098192ff0fe01dd4ef.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014\u2014\u2014wait, hey, what are you doing!?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/46afbac30857f471922df6fbdff29506.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cHello! I\u2019m the one who will save this world!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cA gender-selectable protagonist, fighting in 2D with stunning illustrations!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cMysterious, radiant, <i>ridiculously</i> cute and brilliant\u2014your ultimate savior idol!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/407ea7f2d34ad95e803b2b0fb2e1bbf4.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300cI'm Shuca!\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cI promise! To deliver a world that\u2019s beautiful, disgusting, and hilariously unforgettable!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/c9bdd90e1b742a77ff2ef50f7a94430d.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300c\u300cPlease add us to your wishlist!!!!\u300d\u300d</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong><br><strong>Guidelines for live-playing and derivative works of WAREHUMAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About translation-for translation-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>This is a work with a very large amount of scenario text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We plan to release the game in Japanese, English, Migratory Chinese, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and Simplified Chinese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are planning to release the game in Japanese, English, Chinese merged characters, and Simplified Chinese. Please give me little time.<strong></strong><br><strong></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Break the Prophecies of Doom.</strong> <br>A Norse Mythology \u00d7 Modern Simulation AdventureMassive tsunamis, flame giants, cracks splitting the earth\u2014 In a modern world haunted by whispered &quot;Prophecies of Doom,&quot; <br>a mysterious figure named <strong>Shuka</strong>, who calls himself a &quot;Prophet,&quot; sets out with a group of secretive companions to destroy these prophecies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b3629c30110e06aa9f16d6dc6260da94.poster.avif?t=1752892063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b3629c30110e06aa9f16d6dc6260da94.webm?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b3629c30110e06aa9f16d6dc6260da94.mp4?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simulation adventure set in the modern world, based on the aftermath of the Norse apocalypse\u2014<strong>Ragnar\u00f6k</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the player, you become <strong>Shuka, the Black Angel of Prophecy</strong>,<br>traveling across the lands with local guides to unravel each omen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/f4bc65024f0e77332fe3c53f8eef5441.poster.avif?t=1752892063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/f4bc65024f0e77332fe3c53f8eef5441.webm?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/f4bc65024f0e77332fe3c53f8eef5441.mp4?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through roguelite-style events, battles, and dates,<br>you\u2019ll strengthen your companions and shatter each of the six doomsday prophecies, one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/e18be1a41de015900ad518771a21fabf.poster.avif?t=1752892063\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/e18be1a41de015900ad518771a21fabf.webm?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/e18be1a41de015900ad518771a21fabf.mp4?t=1752892063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through conflict and connection,<br>you\u2019ll uncover your companions\u2019 pasts\u2014and their true intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b333938042336736320759d85c8de630.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of them has something they want to protect,<br>and those desires lead to misunderstandings and friction.What awaits your companions at the end of all shattered prophecies...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b93a1b1c4b7d312be60bdf68fed78cd8.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shuca</strong><br>A mysterious being who declares, \u201cI will destroy the prophecies.\u201d<br>Possesses the power to return from death and gathers companions for his cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/b6abe58ab1b3f2076cc38ea7614cf58c.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yocto Lu</strong><br>A lonely boy from the 1st Land, forcibly recruited by Shuca.<br>Feared and reviled as the \u201cWolf\u201d destined to end the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/8c6975ddcde48fceb33f0638202693e6.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zeyn Guit</strong><br>A mercenary leader in the 2nd Land, hired by Shuca to join the journey.<br>Short-tempered, but acts like a big sister figure who keeps the team in check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/e82d13b18276708830d21c1cada21f6b.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Halvman Fitzgerald</strong><br>A young man from the 3rd Land who joins the journey of his own will.<br>Strategic and devoted, he dotes on Shuca a little <i>too</i> much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/d50f72c7b0e3a6a3faa105087c0f2ffe.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elmi Gale</strong><br>A girl dispatched from the 5th Land. Known for her sharp tongue and cold demeanor.<br>A stoic professional who calmly cleans up any mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Studio Warehuman / Higatani</strong><br>An indie creator based in Aichi, Japan.<br><i>Warehuman</i> is their debut title.<br>They are also the organizer of the indie game exhibition <strong>Aichi Game Castle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Message from the Creator\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I was fascinated by the grotesque beauty of Norse mythology's worldview\u2014<br>where the strong are just and the weak are evil. That\u2019s why I created this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even those who are seen as villains and losers\u2014<br>can still become the light that saves the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made with the hope that it might support those<br>who are struggling in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...And that\u2019s all from m\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/7696829401de0e098192ff0fe01dd4ef.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2014\u2014\u2014wait, hey, what are you doing!?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/46afbac30857f471922df6fbdff29506.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cHello! I\u2019m the one who will save this world!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cA gender-selectable protagonist, fighting in 2D with stunning illustrations!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cMysterious, radiant, <i>ridiculously</i> cute and brilliant\u2014your ultimate savior idol!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/407ea7f2d34ad95e803b2b0fb2e1bbf4.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300cI'm Shuca!\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cI promise! To deliver a world that\u2019s beautiful, disgusting, and hilariously unforgettable!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973160/extras/c9bdd90e1b742a77ff2ef50f7a94430d.avif?t=1752892063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300c\u300cPlease add us to your wishlist!!!!\u300d\u300d</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong><br><strong>Guidelines for live-playing and derivative works of WAREHUMAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About translation-for translation-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>This is a work with a very large amount of scenario text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We plan to release the game in Japanese, English, Migratory Chinese, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and Simplified Chinese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are planning to release the game in Japanese, English, Chinese merged characters, and Simplified Chinese. Please give me little time.<strong></strong><br><strong></strong></p>",
